flowchart TD
    A[Agent] --> B[Discover tools]
    B --> C[Select tool call]
    C --> D[ToolRegistry lookup]
    D --> E{Tool exists?}
    E -- No --> F[ToolResult failed]
    E -- Yes --> G{Enabled?}
    G -- No --> H[ToolResult blocked]
    G -- Yes --> I{Scope OK?}
    I -- No --> H
    I -- Yes --> J{Sensitive approved?}
    J -- No --> H
    J -- Yes --> K[Validate arguments]
    K --> L{Valid?}
    L -- No --> F
    L -- Yes --> M[Execute handler]
    M --> N[Normalize output]
    N --> O[Trace]
    O --> P[ToolResult completed]
